From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukasz M <lukasz1992m+alilinux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:41:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] media: rc: ali-ir: ALi M6303 IR receiver

The controller queues one byte per mark/space run (bit 7 the level, bits
0..6 the length in 8 us ticks); the driver feeds them to rc-core as raw
events for the NEC decoder.  The keymap is chosen by platform data, so the
driver is not tied to one remote.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/mips/ali-c3503d/Makefile        |   2 +-
 arch/mips/ali-c3503d/ali.h           |   1 +
 arch/mips/ali-c3503d/dev-ir.c        |  24 +++++
 drivers/media/rc/Kconfig             |   8 ++
 drivers/media/rc/Makefile            |   1 +
 drivers/media/rc/ali-ir.c            | 153 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/linux/platform_data/ali-ir.h |   9 ++
 7 files changed, 197 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/mips/ali-c3503d/dev-ir.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/rc/ali-ir.c
 create mode 100644 include/linux/platform_data/ali-ir.h

